  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **dick reprise**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **roses are free tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **takin' it to the street**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **north pappy flappy**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2000-07-12.2013transfer** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 156 min [1]\n- **Ween2000-07-12**: source not stated; 28 songs; 153 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Shortly after the show began, Jim had a crippling headache and had to leave; the taper's hotel was across the street [1]\n- The band was reportedly on a tequila binge that day and night [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2000-07-12.2013transfer**: Recorded with AKG 460B microphones with CK61 capsules, through a V2 preamp and SBM1 to D8; transferred via Sony PCM-R500 DAT master in 2013 by John M [1]",
